<html>
<body style="font-family: sans-serif; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 20px;">
  <h2>{{app_name}} - Cashout Requested</h2>
  <p>Your cashout request has been received and is now being reviewed.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>Credits requested: <strong>{{credits}}</strong></li>
    <li>Amount: <strong>{{amount_eur}} EUR</strong></li>
    <li>PayPal account: <strong>{{paypal_email}}</strong></li>
  </ul>
  <p>Your account is temporarily locked from playing until an administrator approves or rejects your request. Your credits are reserved in the meantime.</p>
  <p>If no decision is made within 1 day, the request is automatically cancelled and your credits are returned.</p>
  <p style="color: #666; font-size: 12px;">If you have any questions, please contact support.</p>
</body>
</html>
